  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Children, Communities &amp; Local Governments in a Rural Context</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will create participatory systems and mechanisms for the children in the marginalized rural areas of Udupi and Bellary districts of Karnataka State. It will bring systemic changes for the establishment of child rights friendly, bottom-up and community based approaches; for the prevention of illegal sale of alcohol and alcohol abuse; to provide safe and sustainable livelihood option.</narrative>
  </description>
